# The IDO 7.1 files a compiler driver runs, by name and SHA-256.
# tools/ido/setup finds each one by name under a source directory, checks it against the
# digest here, refuses anything else, and installs the verified copy into the destination
# the version configuration names.
# This is the release the build runs. 7.1 reproduces the cartridge's register allocation
# where 5.3 does not; docs/toolchain.md records the measurement.
# These are the Linux recompilations published by the ido-static-recomp project, not SGI's
# original IRIX binaries, which cannot run here.

